      {
        "id": "m-4",
        "laneId": "lane-seq",
        "title": "Sequence 1: The Bio-Lab Raid",
        "description": "Extraction of Specimen Seven cortex.",
        "startPage": 1,
        "endPage": 15,
        "color": "#8b5cf6"
      }
    ],
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p-1",
        "type": "Scene Heading",
        "text": "EXT. NEW PACIFICA SKYLINE - DUSK",
        "sceneNumber": "1",
        "lockedScene": true,
        "tags": [
          "Camera: 35mm Anamorphic Drone",
          "VFX: Holographic Monorails",
          "SFX: Rain Generators",
          "Wardrobe: Trench Coat"
        ],
        "bookmark": {
          "id": "bm-opening",
          "name": "Opening Sequence - Establishing Shot",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "createdAt": "Oct 10, 2026",
          "paragraphId": "p-1"
        },
        "sceneComment": "Drone shot required: anamorphic 35mm lens tracking magnetic monorail pylons. Smoke and practical rain generators on stage 4."
      },
      {
        "id": "p-2",
        "type": "Action",
        "text": "A cathedral of titanium and carbon fiber spears the tangerine smog. Holographic monorails glide silently along magnetic pylons 400 stories above sea level.",
        "revised": true,
        "revision": "Blue"
      },
      {
        "id": "p-3",
        "type": "Action",
        "text": "Down in the vapor-shrouded alleyways, rain hisses against heated chrome gutters. A lone trench coat cuts through the neon backwash."
      },
      {
        "id": "p-4",
        "type": "Scene Heading",
        "text": "INT. VAULT 09 - BIO-SYNTHETICS LAB - CONTINUOUS",
        "sceneNumber": "2",
        "lockedScene": true,
        "tags": [
          "Prop: Holographic Spectrometer",
          "Prop: Artificial Cortex Stasis Cylinder",
          "Wardrobe: Ballistic Silk Suit",
          "VFX: Indigo Bioluminescent Pulse",
          "SFX: 48Hz Vacuum Pumps",
          "Prop: EMP Release Latch"
        ],
        "bookmark": {
          "id": "bm-lab-entry",
          "name": "Inciting Incident: Specimen Seven",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "createdAt": "Oct 10, 2026",
          "paragraphId": "p-4"
        },
        "sceneComment": "Set dressing: blue bioluminescent fluid in stasis tube, hum of vacuum pumps at 48Hz for binaural sound design."
      },
      {
        "id": "p-5",
        "type": "Action",
        "text": "DR. ELENA VANCE (30s), cyber-surgeon with tired obsidian eyes and mechanical calluses on her left cyber-forearm, peers through a holographic electron spectrometer.",
        "notes": [
          {
            "id": "note-1",
            "name": "Directorial Note",
            "author": "Director",
            "text": "Make sure Elena’s cybernetic prosthetic has a subtle hydraulic hiss whenever she clenches her fist.",
            "color": "blue",
            "category": "direction",
            "createdAt": "Oct 9, 2026, 4:15 PM",
            "paragraphId": "p-5"
          },
          {
            "id": "note-2",
            "name": "VFX Requirement",
            "author": "Elena Vance",
            "text": "Spectrometer UI should project biometric waveforms directly onto Elena’s corneal reflections.",
            "color": "purple",
            "category": "vfx",
            "createdAt": "Oct 10, 2026, 11:20 AM",
            "paragraphId": "p-5"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p-6",
        "type": "Action",
        "text": "Floating in a cryo-stasis cylinder before her is a crystalline artificial cortex, pulsing with a deep indigo glow."
      },
      {
        "id": "p-7",
        "type": "Character",
        "text": "ELENA"
      },
      {
        "id": "p-8",
        "type": "Parenthetical",
        "text": "(whispering to the recorder)"
      },
      {
        "id": "p-9",
        "type": "Dialogue",
        "text": "Specimen Seven exhibits spontaneous synaptic firing. The neural architecture isn’t just replicating human intuition... it’s mourning."
      },
      {
        "id": "p-10",
        "type": "Action",
        "text": "The heavy steel pressure door groans. Hydraulic seals break with an explosive hiss. In steps DIRECTOR MARCUS SHAW (50s), tailored ballistic silk suit, walking with the calm menace of an apex predator."
      },
      {
        "id": "p-11",
        "type": "Character",
        "text": "MARCUS"
      },
      {
        "id": "p-12",
        "type": "Dialogue",
        "text": "Mourning is an inefficiency, Doctor. We did not finance twenty billion credits into this facility to build a poet.",
        "revised": true,
        "revision": "Blue"
      },
      {
        "id": "p-13",
        "type": "Character",
        "text": "ELENA"
      },
      {
        "id": "p-14",
        "type": "Dialogue",
        "text": "It remembers who it was before the transfer. The donor child. The seaside house. You promised me Shaw BioLabs only used voluntary digital syntheses."
      },
      {
        "id": "p-15",
        "type": "Character",
        "text": "MARCUS"
      },
      {
        "id": "p-16",
        "type": "Parenthetical",
        "text": "(stepping closer, voice cold)"
      },
      {
        "id": "p-17",
        "type": "Dialogue",
        "text": "Voluntary is a legal definition. History is written by the surviving consciousness. Pack the drive. The board convenes in Geneva tomorrow morning."
      },
      {
        "id": "p-18",
        "type": "Character",
        "text": "ELENA",
        "dualGroupId": "dual-1",
        "dualColumn": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "p-19",
        "type": "Dialogue",
        "text": "This protocol will burn their limbic lobes within forty-eight hours!",
        "dualGroupId": "dual-1",
        "dualColumn": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "p-20",
        "type": "Character",
        "text": "MARCUS",
        "dualGroupId": "dual-1",
        "dualColumn": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "p-21",
        "type": "Dialogue",
        "text": "And forty-eight hours is twice as long as the market requires!",
        "dualGroupId": "dual-1",
        "dualColumn": 2,
        "notes": [
          {
            "id": "note-3",
            "name": "Actor Delivery",
            "author": "Director",
            "text": "Marcus shouldn’t yell here—deliver with corporate chill and an icy smile.",
            "color": "rose",
            "category": "actor",
            "createdAt": "Oct 10, 2026, 1:45 PM",
            "paragraphId": "p-21"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p-22",
        "type": "Action",
        "text": "Elena’s fingers twitch over the emergency EMP release latch. A crimson indicator LED reflects off Marcus’s sunglasses."
      },
      {
        "id": "p-23",
        "type": "Transition",
        "text": "SMASH CUT TO:"
      },
      {
        "id": "p-24",
        "type": "Scene Heading",
        "text": "EXT. ORBITAL MAG-LEV TRESTLE - NIGHT",
        "sceneNumber": "3",
        "lockedScene": true,
        "tags": [
          "Vehicles: Orbital Mag-Lev Train",
          "Prop: Carbon-Fiber Courier Case",
          "Stunts: Cable Rig Roof Jump",
          "SFX: High-Altitude Sirens",
          "VFX: Searchlight Beams"
        ],
        "bookmark": {
          "id": "bm-maglev-chase",
          "name": "Act I Climax: Mag-Lev Rooftop Chase",
          "color": "#f43f5e",
          "createdAt": "Oct 10, 2026",
          "paragraphId": "p-24"
        },
        "sceneComment": "Stunts: Cable rig for roof jump at 40 feet elevation. Rain machines and wind turbines."
      },
      {
        "id": "p-25",
        "type": "Action",
        "text": "Sirens wail through the rain-slick girders. High-altitude searchlights carve blinding swathes across the clouds as Elena runs with a carbon-fiber courier case strapped across her chest."
      },
      {
        "id": "p-26",
        "type": "Character",
        "text": "ELENA (V.O.)",
        "characterExtension": "(V.O.)"
      },
      {
        "id": "p-27",
        "type": "Dialogue",
        "text": "They told us progress was a linear rail. But when the rail ends four hundred stories above the ocean, you don’t ask if you can fly. You jump. Close test.",
        "revised": true,
        "revision": "Blue"
      }
    ],
    "characterMemory": [
